# Slice 283 probe: code over immutable data binds a catch parameter over the place's name: a working cell written with no value record?  Entry 7.
Data:
    int: x 10
    var:
        int: x 0
    end: var
end: Data
WritesCatch:
    throws: boom
    ---
        throw: boom(5)
        catch: boom (int: x)
            x: x + 1
    ---
    var:
        int: x 2
    end: var
end: WritesCatch
@: held_catch WritesCatch
fn: write_catch (@: d Data) int
    ---
        call: held_catch d
        return: 90
        catch: interpreter ()
            return: 1
    ---
end: write_catch
fn: m () int
    d: immutable: merge(Data)
    return: write_catch(d)
end: m
int: code 7
int: r m()
if: r != 1
    code: 10 + r
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
